# TrueCraft+ Java - full in-game guide
tellraw @s {"text":"========== TrueCraft+ Real Survival (Java) ==========","color":"dark_green"}
tellraw @s {"text":"Dynamic Torch Light - hold a torch, soul torch or lantern (either hand) and a light source follows you. Turn off: /scoreboard players set #light truecraft_cfg 0","color":"yellow"}
tellraw @s {"text":"Better Trades - Traveling Merchants (wandering traders) get 8 premium trades: saddle, name tag, golden apple, ender pearls, XP bottles and more. Everyone also gets a permanent trade discount (Hero of the Village). Disable: /scoreboard players set #trades truecraft_cfg 0 or #discount truecraft_cfg 0","color":"yellow"}
tellraw @s {"text":"Temperature - body 0-100. Freezing below 15, heat exhaustion above 85. Deserts and the Nether cook you; snowfields, mountains, night and rain freeze you. Shelter blends toward cave temperature. Wet clothes steal warmth.","color":"yellow"}
tellraw @s {"text":"Clothing - leather warms (snow/mountains), iron conducts (colder in snow, hotter in desert), chainmail breathes in heat, gold absorbs the sun, diamond/netherite is heavy.","color":"yellow"}
tellraw @s {"text":"Thirst - stand IN water and SNEAK to drink raw water (may sicken you). Sneak ON snow to eat it. Drink a water bottle: near a campfire it counts as BOILED water (+50, always safe), otherwise plain (+35, small risk).","color":"yellow"}
tellraw @s {"text":"Weight - armor kg slows you down: leather 1/3/2/1, iron 2/5/4/2, chain 1/4/3/1, gold 1/3/2/1, diamond 3/6/5/2, netherite 3/7/5/3. 12+ kg Slowness I, 16+ Slowness II. Heavy gear also drains thirst.","color":"yellow"}
tellraw @s {"text":"Camping - campfire nearby warms and dries you. Campfire + bed within reach = Safe Camp: regeneration + faster temperature recovery.","color":"yellow"}
tellraw @s {"text":"Exploration - discovering new biomes gives points. Milestones on days 1/5/10/30/100 give bonus points.","color":"yellow"}
tellraw @s {"text":"HUD - the action bar shows Temp / Thirst / Wetness / Points. Toggle: /scoreboard players set #hud truecraft_cfg 0","color":"yellow"}
tellraw @s {"text":"Ruins - /function truecraft:ruin builds an abandoned camp with a loot chest ~8 blocks ahead (auto ruins may appear as you explore).","color":"yellow"}
tellraw @s {"text":"Sidebar points: /function truecraft:ui/sidebar (off: /function truecraft:ui/sidebar_off) - Uninstall: /function truecraft:uninstall","color":"yellow"}
tellraw @s {"text":"Fabric users: for true smooth dynamic light also check the mod 'LambDynamicLights' - this pack works great without it.","color":"gray"}
